---
interface Props { count: number; }
const { count } = Astro.props;
---
<section id="series" class="series-intro" aria-labelledby="series-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">INTERVIEW NOTES / {count} QUESTIONS</p>
  <h2 id="series-title">AI Agent 面试十问</h2>
  <p class="intro-copy">一道问题，一篇代码拆解。从 RAG 检索与评测，到 SQL 工具、会话记忆、LangGraph 和 MCP；先读一分钟回答，再看机制、代码解析、运行结果与面试追问。结合牛客、博客园的分享，以官方文档和可运行示例核对技术细节。</p>
  <div class="reading-path"><span>01—03 数据与检索</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>04—06 质量与执行</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>07—10 状态与协议</span></div>
  <div class="reading-path"><a href="/examples/agent-lab.zip" download>下载完整 Python 示例 ↓</a><a href="/examples/agent-lab/README.md">环境与运行说明 ↗</a></div>
  <p class="date-note">按系列顺序阅读 · 自定义归档日期用于编排，整理时间见正文 · 文章保留原文作者与来源</p>
</section>
<style>
  .series-intro { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.6rem; background: var(--muted); padding: 1.6rem 1.8rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 2.2rem; scroll-margin-top: 2rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--accent); font: 0.62rem/1.5 ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin: 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 650; margin: 0.65rem 0; }
  .intro-copy { color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.95; max-width: 45rem; margin: 0; }
  .reading-path { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.55rem 0.8rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: 0.7rem; }
  .reading-path span { padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.3rem; background: var(--background); }
  .reading-path i { color: var(--accent); font-style: normal; }
  .reading-path a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; margin-right: 1rem; }
  .date-note { color: var(--muted-foreground); font-size: 0.65rem; margin: 1rem 0 0; line-height: 1.9; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .series-intro { padding: 1.25rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; } .reading-path { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.35rem; } .reading-path i { padding-left: 0.8rem; transform: rotate(90deg); } }
</style>
